  <body>
    <div class="container" id="base64-encoding">
      <h2><a href="./index.html">Go в примери</a>: Превръщане в Base64</h2>
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Го предоставя вградена поддръжка за превръщане на данни в base64 (основа 64)
и обратно превръщане от него в изходен вид. За приложението на този вид
изобразяване на данни вижте (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base64).</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code empty leading">
            
          
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            <a href="https://go.dev/play/p/McSpUl_A7zg"><img title="Run code" src="play.png" class="run" /></a><img title="Copy code" src="clipboard.png" class="copy" />
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Така внасяме пакета <code>encoding/base64</code> – с по-кратко име, за да пишем
по-малко.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">b64</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;encoding/base64&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;fmt&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Ето низът, който ще превърнем и после ще върнем в изходния му вид.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">данни</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;абв123!?$*&amp;()&#39;-=@~&#34;</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Го поддържа както обикновено, така и съвместимо с изто̀чници превръщане.
Превръщачът очаква данни от вида <code>[]byte</code>, така че трябва да превърнем
нашия низ първо в такъв вид.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">sEnc</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">b64</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">StdEncoding</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">EncodeToString</span><span class="p">([]</span><span class="nb">byte</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">данни</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">sEnc</span><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Превръщането може да върне грешка. Можете да я обработите, ако не сте
сигурни дали входните данни са правилни.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">sDec</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">_</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">b64</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">StdEncoding</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">DecodeString</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">sEnc</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">string</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">sDec</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">()</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Следните редове превръщат в съвместим с изто̀чници вид и обратно.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">uEnc</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">b64</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">URLEncoding</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">EncodeToString</span><span class="p">([]</span><span class="nb">byte</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">данни</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">uEnc</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">uDec</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">_</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">b64</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">URLEncoding</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">DecodeString</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">uEnc</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">string</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nx">uDec</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Произведеният вид леко се различава между обикновеното и
съвместимото с изто̀чници превръщане (завършващ знак + вместо -),
но и в двата случая обратното превръщане води до един и същи
първоначален вид данни.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="gp">$</span> go run base64-encoding.go 
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">0LDQsdCyMTIzIT8kKiYoKSctPUB+
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">абв123!?$*&amp;()&#39;-=@~</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">0LDQsdCyMTIzIT8kKiYoKSctPUB-
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">абв123!?$*&amp;()&#39;-=@~</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
      
